WEBVTT

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.260
Whoa! Another throw from Umeya!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.780
You're pretty good for a freshman.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.500
Thanks.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.740
But how will you deal with <i>this</i>?!

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.820
<i>You've done well to endure our rigorous 
training regime to get to this point.</i>

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.270
<i>Your judo skills are the real deal.</i>

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:42.140
<i>I entrust Fujimi High School's
judo team to you!</i>

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:46.610
<i>The path to the top of Japan will 
no doubt be rocky and punishing,</i>

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:49.980
<i>but I'm sure you can do it, Umeya Tsubasa!</i>

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.030
<i>I know...</i>

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.450
<i>I know that you can persevere!</i>

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>#08</b>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>Umeya-kun Is Very Patient</b>

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:38.900
My name's Umeya. I'm a freshman, and I'm
joining the soccer team from today.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:43.010
Umeya hasn't played soccer before, 
so teach him what you can, guys.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.470
Yes, sir.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:48.850
I may not be worthy, but I am 
extremely grateful for your tutelage.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.570
This guy's so freakin' stiff!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.360
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.350
Hold it right there!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.290
What do you mean you're quitting
the judo team, Umeya?!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.980
What's happening?

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.250
Why is the judo coach here?

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.530
You were so serious about judo!

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.510
Why are you switching to soccer
all of a sudden?!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:22.220
You <i>must</i> have felt yourself 
improving and making great strides!

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:28.260
Wait, was it my cool teaching style?

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.660
Did you not like it?!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.060
What?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.990
You mean overbearing, no?

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:37.480
I can't believe he's actually
asking that for real.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.570
No... No! No! No!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.110
I can see others doing this,

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:45.490
but it doesn't make sense for 
someone with your perseverance!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.370
I'll carry that for you.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.880
What?!

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>I-It can't be.</i>

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.340
<i>You, an avatar of academic and athletic
excellence, of austerity and fortitude,</i>

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.500
<i>are doing this for a </i>girl<i>?!</i>

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.300
Wh-Who are you?

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.740
I've lost all respect for you, Umeya!

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.620
As the judo coach, I cannot allow this!

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:15.150
I don't like it, but I'll have to
beat some sense into you!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.740
Whoa, the new guy threw him!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:31.470
I'm sorry, sir, but my mind is made up.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.590
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.500
What do you think of the new guy?

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.550
What, you ask? It's dead obvious 
that he has a thing for Gotou-chan.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.510
Poor guy.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:05:00.440
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:59.690
I mean, Gotou-chan's love 
for Aoyama is unshakable.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:07.420
He's giving her such a passionate stare,
but she hasn't even noticed...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:11.910
He even quit judo, the sport
he'd been playing all his life.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.000
Hey, new guy!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.290
If you're here for some ridiculous reason,

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.860
haul your ass back 
to the judo team right now!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.950
We're serious about going to Nationals!

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.220
I'm serious, too.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.390
That counts as "ridiculous"!
Look at me when I'm talking to you!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.710
Nice shot, Aoyama!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.020
Aoyama...

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.120
I'd like to face you, one-on-one.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.450
Oh, the new guy challenged Aoyama!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.900
Well, this was to be expected, though.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:07.780
A newbie taking on Aoyama 
is reckless behavior.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.500
I don't know about that.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.470
You're here again?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.340
No matter how strong
an opponent Umeya's facing,

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.300
he never panics or gets discouraged.

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:23.440
And he refuses to give up to the very end.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.610
So close, new guy!

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.580
The tackle didn't work,
but I'm amazed he even caught up to him.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.700
He's got amazing athletic ability.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.540
Seriously. And remember, he was doing
nothing but judo until yesterday.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.970
He's quick on the uptake.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.810
He's the shining star of the judo team.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:45.590
Actually, he's ours now.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.970
Even if he's no match for his opponent now,
he'll definitely win in the end.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.070
That's the kind of judo he champions.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.900
Wait, don't you have your own practice now?
What are you doing here?

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.860
Umeya! Come back to the judo team!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.740
I'll always be waiting for your return!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.780
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.380
His motivation may be questionable,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.750
but he looks game-ready.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:26.380
A-o-ya-ma! Clean, clean!

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:30.670
A-o-ya-ma! Love!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.150
Wh-What is it?

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:47.830
<i>H-He's so tall.</i>

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.540
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:56.070
I'm the new guy, Umeya Tsubasa.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.760
I'll help.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:00.540
Huh?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.190
Th-Thank you.

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.660
Oh!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.990
What have we here?

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.820
He's making a move.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:18.730
Looks like he plans to score brownie points
with Gotou-chan by helping her clean.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.970
But all that cleaning's for Aoyama
in the first place.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.310
She's so admirable.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.070
Yep.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.240
Hey, Gotou-chan! This is the guy's bathroom!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.540
I was cleaning Aoyama-kun's toile—

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.450
You can't come in
when there are people in here!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.500
You can't even when <i>nobody's</i> in here!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.710
No girls allowed!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.060
Aoyama.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:01.930
Good morning.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.910
U-Umeya-kun?

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.620
I'll help.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.690
U-Uh...

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.470
I'll help.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:52.320
Umeya-kun, use these.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.750
I mean, if you're barehanded,
your skin will get all rough.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.200
I always carry a spare pair, anyway,
and they're cheap,

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:02.280
and they're too big for me, 
but they should fit you.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:06.250
You don't have to return them! 
It's just as a thank you, or well...

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:10.190
I'm happy to have you helping me out.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.010
Thank you.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:23.690
Huh.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:24.250
Huh.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:24.940
Huh.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.840
He sure is relentless, isn't he?

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:33.170
All that cleaning you're helping with
is something she does for Aoyama...

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.520
This is just so...

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.490
Good luck, new guy!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:41.250
We're cheering for your love!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:42.160
<b>Ardent Umeya Support Group</b>

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:54.090
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.150
All right.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.210
Gotou.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.790
That Aoyama!

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.980
He's cleaning the spot that 
Gotou-chan's already cleaned!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.570
Why do you like Aoyama so much?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.280
Huh?

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.320
Well...

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.500
By the time I realized...

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.560
Before I knew it...

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.130
<i>I'd already started feeling this way.</i>

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:35.930
<i>I'm the same.</i>

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.250
Hey, Aoyama!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.820
A direct confrontation?!

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:08.020
Gotou's already cleaned that sink.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.250
I see.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:13.700
Thank you,

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.950
Gotou Moka.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.030
But I can't relax unless I do it myself.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.260
You idiot!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:26.860
Four eyes-san.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.280
This is why you are just so...

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.220
Yep.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:33.690
You're denser than lead!

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:33.690
<b>Aoyama
 Life</b>

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:32.450
Gotou.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.650
Your feelings...

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.740
I'll help them come true.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:46.030
<b>You just need to
 win in the end</b>

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:46.030
<b>Umeya Tsubasa</b>

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.990
<b>Umeya, come back
 to the judo team!</b>

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.990
<b>Jinnai Daisuke</b>

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.620
<b>Cat 
Festival</b>

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:54.300
Aoyama, this weekend,
the zoo in Inugashira Park

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.960
is going to hold a cat festival
overflowing with cats.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:00.260
Wanna come?

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.130
With Gotou and me?

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.540
This is it.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:08.460
Four eyes, Yocchi...
What do you make of Umeya?

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.740
I'm not sure.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.770
He's supposed to like Gotou-chan,

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.650
but he's gone out of his way 
to invite Aoyama to the zoo.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.190
Wait! That turd!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:26.700
Under the guise of rooting for her,
he'll force her into a bad decision.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.200
"Rejected!"

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:33.160
Then he plans to console the brokenhearted
Gotou-chan and make her his own!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.120
That bastard!

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:38.020
He's so smart.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:38.860
Yeah.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:39.530
Isn't he just?

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:43.050
Not the point!
That's not happening on our watch!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.020
Looks like it's come to this.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:01.060
As her seniors, we have no choice 
but to protect Gotou-chan!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:08.050
<i>I-I'm about to go on
a d-date with Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:14.060
<i>I'm so nervous, I could die at any moment!</i>

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.110
Aoyama.

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:22.810
I think it's still too early
to bring those out.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:23.940
Really?

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:32.050
The cat festival isn't starting for a while. 
Why don't we go look at some other animals?

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.290
Gotou, you'll get lost 
if you don't walk with us.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.770
<i>Oh no, my old habit!</i>

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:46.770
So huge.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.670
So tiny.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.060
It moved.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.660
It won't move.

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:57.670
What is it with them?

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:02.660
Gotou-chan's looking at Aoyama, 
and Umeya's looking at Gotou-chan.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:06.090
Only Aoyama's actually 
looking at the animals!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.730
Gotou...

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.890
Since you're here with Aoyama and all,
why don't you talk to him?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.520
I... I...

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:28.730
I-I'm so nervous, I don't know what to shay.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:29.810
Don't worry.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.870
Just tell him whatever is on your mind.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.740
Be honest.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.240
I knew it!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.420
He's trying to make her
confess her feelings!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.700
It's almost time for the cat festival.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.260
<b>Cat Cat House</b>

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:49.260
All right. This is the cat festival 
where you can play with the cats!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:54.220
Everybody, please enjoy 
playing with all the kitties!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:02.700
H-Hey! Please don't hog all the cats!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:06.150
But this person's got some amazing 
skills with those cat toys!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.650
Cute.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.500
Master!

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.410
Odagiri Mio.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:23.000
You, too! Please don't hog the cats!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:27.960
Fancy meeting you here.
You're a cat person, too, huh?

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:31.170
<b>High five memory!</b>

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:34.740
Heya.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.100
Odagiri-san?

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:50.300
This is chaos.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:56.700
Umeya likes Gotou-chan, and she likes Aoyama.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.780
The three of them were already a weird group.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.910
Now, on top of that,
Odagiri's been thrown into the mix, too.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:06.380
It was a real surprise to find out
that you like cats, master.

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.390
But they're so cute, aren't they?

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:11.000
<i>Odagiri-san really is cute.</i>

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.800
<i>And she's got a great figure to go
with her cheerful and energetic nature.</i>

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.970
I'm sorry.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.430
<i>She can even touch Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:23.960
What the hell is this?

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.390
Stop with the mushy stuff!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.380
Huh? You got a problem?!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:38.280
This is weird. Umeya's supposed 
to be a whiz at judo.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.870
<i>I need to protect Aoyama-kun!</i>

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.050
All right! Everybody, run!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.180
That was so scary.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:08.780
Gotou-san, you can run so fast!
You're amazing!

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:10.980
Huh? I'm not, uh, thank you!

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:18.070
<i>She's so nice. She's a thousand times
 more suitable for Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.000
<i>Could it be that he's...</i>

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.270
Before we leave,
shouldn't we have a go on those boats?

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.140
Count me in!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.180
Let's go, Yuu-chan!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.890
Umeya!

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.350
There!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.330
Oh! Master!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:02.050
I'm sorry, but please 
don't interrupt those two.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:03.870
Huh?

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:08.710
Wow!

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:12.470
Hey, you like Gotou-san, don't you?

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.670
Why are you trying to set them up?

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.130
<i>I...</i>

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:31.520
<i>I'm here with Aoyama-kun, but I haven't 
been able to say a single word.</i>

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:35.260
<i>Being with me must be so boring.</i>

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:39.490
<i>I bet he would've preferred to
ride with Odagiri-san.</i>

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.150
<i>I...</i>

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.470
Hey, Gotou!

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.340
What's going on?

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.690
Dammit, we're too far away. 
I can't hear anything!

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:57.780
Faster, you guys!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.260
Then you peddle, too!

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:06.010
How was today? Did you have fun?

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.330
<i>Umeya-kun...</i>

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:15.870
<i>Good luck.</i>

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:22.150
<i>Just tell him whatever is on your mind.</i>

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.980
A-Aoyama-kun.

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:31.310
<i>Be honest.</i>

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:37.950
I-I haven't been able to say anything all day,

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.020
but I really had a lot of fun today!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:47.380
Don't tell me...

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.210
Is Umeya seriously rooting for those two?

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.690
I had fun!

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:57.290
I see.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.170
Fishies. Fishies.

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.500
You...

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:06.340
I just want to protect her feelings.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.430
So you'd be fine if they dated?

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:11.670
Yes.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.510
As long as I can be buried 
alongside her, I'm fine.

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.670
What kind of long-term plan is that?!

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:27.020
Not every couple is destined to marry.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.230
I just have to be patient 
until the time comes.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:39.250
That's the man I put my 
faith in: Umeya Tsubasa!

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:44.550
That's what I love about you!
Your unwavering perseverance!

00:23:28.150 --> 00:23:30.190
I understand how you feel.

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:32.580
Right now, what the soccer team needs...

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:35.050
...is a training camp.

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Miwa-chan Wants to 
Do a Training Camp</b>
